<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Confidence boost in Australian rates - Howard.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Confidence boost in Australian rates - Howard.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian Prime Minister John Howard said on Thursday that Wednesday's interest rate cut and good jobs data on Thursday would boost consumer confidence.  </p>
<p>&quot;The combination of a cut in interest rates and better than expected employment figures on the eve of Christmas will boost consumer confidence,&quot; Howard told parliament.</p>
</text>
